{"created": "2023-11-06T11:39:04.243582+00:00", "modified": "2023-11-06T11:39:05.724711+00:00", "id": 10074634, "conceptrecid": "10074633", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.10074634", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.10074633", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10074634", "metadata": {"title": "Datasets and codes for \"Exploiting high-resolution ADS-B data for flight operation reconstruction towards environmental impact assessment\"", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.10074634", "publication_date": "2023-11-06", "description": "<p>Here you can find all the datasets and Python codes used to obtain the results illustrated in \"Exploiting high-resolution ADS-B data for flight operation reconstruction towards environmental impact assessment\" (authors: Marco Pretto, Lorenzo Dorbol\u00f2, Pietro Giannattasio).</p><p>Folders are in the following order:</p><ul><li>0_files: flight tracking data (from the OpenSky Network) and open databeses</li><li>1_preproc: flight separation algorithm</li><li>2_preproc: runway assignment algorithm</li><li>3_proc: ground track reconstruction algorithm</li><li>4_postproc: postprocessing codes (for figures)</li></ul>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Dorbol\u00f2, Lorenzo", "affiliation": null}], "contributors": [{"name": "Pretto, Marco", "affiliation": null, "type": "ProjectMember", "orcid": "0000-0003-1194-0658"}, {"name": "Giannattasio, Pietro", "affiliation": null, "type": "Supervisor", "orcid": "0000-0001-7853-6145"}], "keywords": ["Civil air traffic", "ADS-B data", "flight operations", "ground track", "environmental impact"], "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "10074633"}}]}}, "title": "Datasets and codes for \"Exploiting high-resolution ADS-B data for flight operation reconstruction towards environmental impact assessment\"", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10074634", "self_html": "https://zenodo